// ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
// One GUI: label and one TOOLTIP: line per row of TheOptionCatalog.  A label
// and the combo box under it share the tooltip; an OPTION_ENUM row also needs
// its entries, numbered from zero in the order the enum declares them.
// ---------------------------------------------------------------------------

GUI:WindowMode
"Window Mode"
END

GUI:WindowMode0
"Fullscreen"
END

GUI:WindowMode1
"Borderless"
END

GUI:WindowMode2
"Windowed"
END

TOOLTIP:WindowMode
"Fullscreen takes the display mode, borderless covers it with a window and alt-tabs instantly. Borderless picks the resolution itself, so the list on the left is yours in the other two."
END

GUI:MSAA
"Antialiasing"
END

GUI:MSAA0
"Off"
END

GUI:MSAA1
"2x"
END

GUI:MSAA2
"4x"
END

GUI:MSAA3
"8x"
END

GUI:MSAA4
"16x"
END

TOOLTIP:MSAA
"Smooths the stair steps along model edges. A level your card does not offer drops to the highest one it does. Applied when the display device is next reset."
END

GUI:Bloom
"Bloom"
END

TOOLTIP:Bloom
"How much bright surfaces glow into what is around them. Zero turns it off."
END

GUI:BloomThreshold
"Bloom Threshold"
END

TOOLTIP:BloomThreshold
"The brightness below which nothing glows. Lower it and more of the picture joins in."
END

GUI:MiddleMousePans
"Middle Mouse Pans"
END

TOOLTIP:MiddleMousePans
"Hold the middle button to drag the map under the cursor."
END

GUI:ZoomToCursor
"Zoom To Cursor"
END

TOOLTIP:ZoomToCursor
"The wheel zooms towards whatever the cursor is over instead of the middle of the screen."
END

GUI:EdgeScrollWindowed
"Edge Scroll In A Window"
END

TOOLTIP:EdgeScrollWindowed
"Retail refuses to scroll from the screen edge in windowed mode. Turn this on to get it back on a second monitor or in borderless."
END

GUI:SnapCamera45
"Snap Camera Rotation"
END

TOOLTIP:SnapCamera45
"Rotating the camera clicks to the eight 45 degree headings instead of stopping anywhere."
END

GUI:GridBuild
"Grid Building Placement"
END

TOOLTIP:GridBuild
"Structures land on the pathfinder's own 10-unit grid, so two buildings put down by eye share an edge instead of leaving a gap too narrow to walk through."
END

GUI:NudgeBuild
"Nudge Blocked Placement"
END

TOOLTIP:NudgeBuild
"A structure whose spot is blocked slides to the nearest one it fits instead of going red under the cursor."
END

GUI:SnapBuild45
"Snap Building Rotation"
END

TOOLTIP:SnapBuild45
"Drag-to-rotate clicks to the eight 45 degree headings, which is what walls and defenses along a base edge want."
END

GUI:RangeRing
"Placement Range Ring"
END

TOOLTIP:RangeRing
"Draws the weapon range of the structure you are about to place."
END

GUI:WorkersReturn
"Workers Return To Supply"
END

TOOLTIP:WorkersReturn
"A worker that finishes a building goes back to gathering instead of standing where it built."
END

GUI:BuildTooltips
"Detailed Build Tooltips"
END

TOOLTIP:BuildTooltips
"Build buttons list cost, build time and prerequisites."
END

GUI:HudOverlay
"HUD Overlay"
END

TOOLTIP:HudOverlay
"The extra readouts across the top of the screen: power, income and the production strip."
END

GUI:ArchiveReplays
"Archive Replays"
END

TOOLTIP:ArchiveReplays
"Every game is kept under its own name instead of overwriting the last one."
END

